cious. While they could have A-10 or a straight, the betting pattern suggests this is more likely a bluff or a weaker hand trying to push me off the pot. With such a strong made hand, I cannot fold to a single all-in bet. The pot odds and hand strength justify calling.\n\n**Answer: -2**"}
