h only a pair of 5s and an 8 kicker, I have an extremely weak hand. The opponent's river bet after checking throughout suggests either they hit something (flush, Ace, or better pair) or are making a move. Given the three hearts on board and the Ace, there are many hands that beat me. The pot odds don't justify calling with such a weak holding, and I'm already ahead in the overall match. Folding preserves my chips for better spots in the remaining 15 hands.\n\nAnswer: -1"}
