r, with only Jack-high, I'm almost certainly behind even a weak holding like a small pair. Since checking costs me nothing and I've already invested minimal chips (just the big blind of 100), I should check and go to showdown. Bluffing here would risk significant chips when my opponent has shown no fold equity through their checking pattern. The pot is small, and risking my stack on a bluff isn't justified.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
