d, possibly trips, two pair, or a better pair. Given that I'm ahead by 16,300 chips cumulatively with only 2 hands remaining after this one, I should avoid risking chips on marginal situations. Folding preserves my chip lead and tournament equity.\n\nAnswer: -1"}
